      "purpose": "Define the minimum immutable record of one bounded Plan Keeper reasoning episode over exact planning inputs. The episode preserves observations, assumptions, candidate paths, evaluations, material Unknowns, and a recommendation without turning workspace content into Strategy or granting the episode authority to revise the Strategic Plan.\n",
